--- the grade ladder, in aim-error metres (NOT convertible to the above) ---
  Novice      handicap 0.70 -> AI error 2.35 (at the ramp midpoint 1.65)
  Apprentice  handicap 0.70 -> AI error 2.35 (at the ramp midpoint 1.65)
  Skilled     handicap 0.35 -> AI error 2.00 (at the ramp midpoint 1.65)
