--- what the runtime must measure to close the gap ---
  TelemetrySink.AiHits / AiShots against AiMeanAimError:
  that pair converts metres of aim error into points of hit rate, which is
  the same unit as the quality penalty above. Until then the handicap has a
  rationale (20% of the ramp span per grade) and no predicted effect size.
